WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.700
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.970 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.090 --> 01:43.670
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.670 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 14]

5
01:57.789 --> 02:01.260
[Pure as Sea Water]

6
02:09.180 --> 02:18.070
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

7
02:18.870 --> 02:19.680
My Lord.

8
02:20.430 --> 02:21.400
These divers

9
02:21.400 --> 02:23.079
are the best swimmers in the Yan River.

10
02:23.079 --> 02:24.630
They are all at your disposal, My Lord.

11
02:24.630 --> 02:26.590
Braving the waves is a common occurrence for them.

12
02:26.590 --> 02:28.120
Please take a look, My Lord.

13
02:28.840 --> 02:29.960
-My Lord. -My Lord.

14
02:32.840 --> 02:32.970
But there is one thing I don't understand.

15
02:32.970 --> 02:35.560
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

16
02:35.560 --> 02:36.360
My Lord,

17
02:36.400 --> 02:37.870
how did you foresee

18
02:37.870 --> 02:39.800
that Ji Ada would fall into the sea?

19
02:42.000 --> 02:43.310
I am not a god.

20
02:43.430 --> 02:46.190
How could I have predicted Mr. Ji falling into the sea?

21
02:46.190 --> 02:47.190
But aren't these people

22
02:47.190 --> 02:48.990
you ordered me to find in advance

23
02:49.190 --> 02:51.590
to salvage the body from the sea?

24
02:54.020 --> 02:55.840
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

25
02:55.840 --> 02:56.960
Lord Situ.

26
02:58.470 --> 02:59.560
The rain today

27
03:00.000 --> 03:02.840
looks even heavier than it has been over the past few days.

28
03:02.840 --> 03:03.750
Indeed.

29
03:04.430 --> 03:06.590
The flood channel we just built a few days ago

30
03:06.590 --> 03:08.790
has been washed away in several places.

31
03:11.150 --> 03:12.350
Then in your opinion,

32
03:12.840 --> 03:14.840
when will the rain stop?

33
03:15.960 --> 03:17.560
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

34
03:17.560 --> 03:18.820
It will stop tomorrow.

35
03:22.560 --> 03:24.400
How are things at the Gong family?

36
03:24.400 --> 03:25.960
No one has left Mingling.

37
03:26.000 --> 03:26.800
In fact,

38
03:27.000 --> 03:29.200
few people have even left Gong Mansion.

39
03:30.000 --> 03:30.840
Good.

40
03:34.750 --> 03:36.610
When the rain clears up tomorrow,

41
03:37.030 --> 03:37.960
the real show

42
03:38.430 --> 03:39.800
will begin.

43
03:42.000 --> 03:42.800
Open the garden.

44
03:42.800 --> 03:43.520
Yes.

45
03:47.590 --> 03:49.470
Don't smash it! Don't smash it!

46
03:49.680 --> 03:51.079
You can't smash it!

47
03:51.470 --> 03:52.280
You...

48
03:52.280 --> 03:52.960
I...

49
03:53.360 --> 03:54.280
You can't smash it!

50
03:54.280 --> 03:55.030
My Lord!

51
03:55.750 --> 03:56.960
You can't open it, My Lord.

52
03:56.960 --> 03:58.280
Our Master has already had it divined.

53
03:58.280 --> 04:00.190
This house faces an inauspicious direction.

54
04:00.190 --> 04:02.280
That's why it was sealed.

55
04:02.280 --> 04:03.590
If you smash the lock and open it rashly,

56
04:03.590 --> 04:05.470
it will definitely bring disaster, My Lord.

57
04:05.470 --> 04:06.800
How dare you, insolent commoner!

58
04:06.800 --> 04:08.000
If you dare to keep pestering,

59
04:08.000 --> 04:08.840
I will punish you for

60
04:08.840 --> 04:10.310
obstructing official duties!

61
04:10.310 --> 04:11.120
Open it!

62
04:11.360 --> 04:12.150
Hold on!

63
04:12.430 --> 04:13.240
Master!

64
04:13.800 --> 04:15.060
Even the county office

65
04:15.240 --> 04:18.370
cannot force their way into a private residence, right?

66
04:18.800 --> 04:19.600
My Lord,

67
04:19.600 --> 04:21.040
this is Gong Mansion.

68
04:21.430 --> 04:22.750
Appointed by His Majesty,

69
04:22.750 --> 04:25.010
we handle official maritime transport.

70
04:25.040 --> 04:27.270
Since we both serve the imperial court,

71
04:27.630 --> 04:28.360
I wonder

72
04:28.360 --> 04:30.120
if you could do me a favor.

73
04:30.830 --> 04:32.430
If there really is a problem,

74
04:33.040 --> 04:34.390
let's talk inside.

75
04:35.430 --> 04:36.560
Fourth Master Gong.

76
04:44.159 --> 04:45.290
Fourth Master Gong.

77
04:45.600 --> 04:47.330
We came to your residence today

78
04:47.360 --> 04:48.870
not as guests.

79
04:49.800 --> 04:51.000
The Divine Constable Bureau is handling a case.

80
04:51.000 --> 04:51.159
[Divine Constable Tally]

81
04:51.159 --> 04:52.630
Anyone who attempts to obstruct us

82
04:52.630 --> 04:55.120
can be executed under Great Shi law.

83
04:56.950 --> 04:58.610
So it is the Divine Constable.

84
04:59.240 --> 05:01.360
What brings you here today,

85
05:01.680 --> 05:02.870
My Lord?

86
05:03.630 --> 05:05.040
It's nothing major.

87
05:05.430 --> 05:06.960
We are here to save someone.

88
05:07.070 --> 05:08.000
Save someone?

89
05:10.800 --> 05:12.750
You must be joking, My Lord.

90
05:12.830 --> 05:13.800
This garden of mine

91
05:13.800 --> 05:15.510
has been closed for years.

92
05:15.600 --> 05:16.560
Normally,

93
05:16.630 --> 05:18.160
no one ever enters.

94
05:18.240 --> 05:20.240
So how could there be anyone to save?

95
05:20.630 --> 05:21.560
A few days ago,

96
05:22.000 --> 05:23.360
Ji Ada fell into the sea.

97
05:23.480 --> 05:24.680
Have you heard?

98
05:25.040 --> 05:26.640
I have indeed heard about it.

99
05:27.240 --> 05:28.560
But Ji Ada

100
05:28.750 --> 05:30.360
fell into the sea.

101
05:30.600 --> 05:31.650
How could he be

102
05:31.670 --> 05:33.040
in my Cui Garden?

103
05:33.630 --> 05:35.159
They are not connected.

104
05:35.630 --> 05:38.230
You are absolutely right, Fourth Master Gong.

105
05:38.480 --> 05:39.720
This lake and the sea

106
05:39.800 --> 05:41.270
are separate entities.

107
05:41.560 --> 05:42.430
It seems

108
05:42.830 --> 05:44.430
they are indeed not connected.

109
05:44.430 --> 05:45.870
But who can say for sure

110
05:46.240 --> 05:48.000
that beneath this vast expanse of water,

111
05:48.000 --> 05:49.600
there are no secret passages

112
05:49.950 --> 05:51.430
or hidden connections?

113
05:54.930 --> 05:57.550
[Kindness Worthy of Emulation]

114
06:16.310 --> 06:17.120
My Lord,

115
06:17.680 --> 06:19.540
what exactly are you trying to do?

116
06:19.950 --> 06:21.070
Divine Constable Li,

117
06:21.070 --> 06:22.130
please be patient.

118
06:22.240 --> 06:23.570
In less than four hours,

119
06:23.630 --> 06:24.800
we can search the bottom of this lake

120
06:24.800 --> 06:25.800
thoroughly.

121
06:25.800 --> 06:26.480
Good.

122
06:44.920 --> 06:45.720
Stop!

123
06:46.190 --> 06:48.560
The county office and the Divine Constable Bureau are investigating a case.

124
06:48.560 --> 06:49.800
Everyone in the residence

125
06:49.800 --> 06:51.800
must not leave without permission!

126
06:57.040 --> 06:57.870
My Lord.

127
06:58.190 --> 06:59.360
What crime

128
06:59.600 --> 07:01.000
have I committed?

129
07:01.560 --> 07:02.800
If you still suspect me

130
07:02.800 --> 07:04.560
of killing Zhe Shan of the Ji family,

131
07:04.560 --> 07:05.510
wasn't I already

132
07:05.750 --> 07:06.720
summoned

133
07:06.720 --> 07:07.750
and questioned?

134
07:07.750 --> 07:09.610
Don't worry, Fourth Master Gong.

135
07:09.950 --> 07:11.630
We have already caught the murderer

136
07:11.630 --> 07:13.070
who killed Zhe Shan.

137
07:13.390 --> 07:15.390
It indeed has nothing to do with you.

138
07:15.630 --> 07:16.430
However,

139
07:17.000 --> 07:18.860
there is another matter right now

140
07:20.190 --> 07:21.800
that is related to you.

141
07:51.680 --> 07:52.870
Huang Mazi?

142
07:53.830 --> 07:54.800
Weren't you eaten by

143
07:54.800 --> 07:56.200
the green-haired demon?

144
07:57.560 --> 07:58.360
It seems

145
07:58.950 --> 07:59.720
you two

146
07:59.740 --> 08:01.270
are old acquaintances.

147
08:02.800 --> 08:03.730
Huang Bingshui.

148
08:03.800 --> 08:05.430
Tell us the evidence

149
08:05.430 --> 08:07.190
of your accusations against Ji Ada and Gong Sihai

150
08:07.190 --> 08:08.560
in full detail.

151
08:13.270 --> 08:14.720
Yes, My Lord.

152
08:17.430 --> 08:19.360
Everyone in Mingling County knows

153
08:19.750 --> 08:21.350
that the Gong and Ji families

154
08:21.430 --> 08:23.490
are usually at each other's throats.

155
08:23.750 --> 08:25.630
They have had many fights over this.

156
08:25.630 --> 08:26.480
But these

157
08:26.800 --> 08:27.480
were all intentionally

158
08:27.480 --> 08:29.040
put on as a show for outsiders.

159
08:29.040 --> 08:30.570
It's to deceive the public.

160
08:31.270 --> 08:32.200
Secretly,

161
08:32.870 --> 08:34.760
Gong Sihai and my master

162
08:34.789 --> 08:36.120
have been colluding with each other.

163
08:36.120 --> 08:36.789
They took the government salt

164
08:36.789 --> 08:38.270
the Gong family was transporting,

165
08:38.270 --> 08:39.549
hid it in the Hound Pit,

166
08:41.030 --> 08:42.360
and made it into salt bricks.

167
08:42.360 --> 08:43.760
After the heat died down,

168
08:44.000 --> 08:45.790
they put them into rice bags,

169
08:45.790 --> 08:46.510
disguised them as rice,

170
08:46.510 --> 08:47.350
and sold them.

171
08:47.350 --> 08:48.120
[Grain]

172
08:48.120 --> 08:49.000
This has been going on

173
08:49.000 --> 08:50.600
for decades.

174
08:52.120 --> 08:52.870
The dirty money

175
08:52.870 --> 08:54.150
they have made

176
08:55.440 --> 08:57.390
could already pile up into mountains of gold and silver.

177
08:57.390 --> 08:58.030
You...

178
08:58.200 --> 08:59.840
You are talking nonsense!

179
08:59.840 --> 09:01.370
Don't be in a hurry to argue.

180
09:02.360 --> 09:03.960
With all the evidence today,

181
09:04.440 --> 09:06.900
you will definitely not escape punishment.

182
09:07.600 --> 09:08.440
Found it!

183
09:08.630 --> 09:09.510
Found it!

184
09:10.600 --> 09:11.510
Found it!

185
09:14.270 --> 09:15.170
Found it!

186
09:18.790 --> 09:19.630
Hurry!

187
09:19.750 --> 09:20.440
Take him away.

188
09:20.440 --> 09:21.080
Yes.

189
09:31.510 --> 09:32.320
These...

190
09:33.150 --> 09:34.610
These are all human bones.

191
09:34.770 --> 09:36.200
How can there be so many human bones?

192
09:36.200 --> 09:37.240
What's the situation down there?

193
09:37.240 --> 09:38.150
My Lord,

194
09:38.360 --> 09:39.760
this is only a small part.

195
09:39.790 --> 09:41.360
There are many more at the bottom of the lake.

196
09:41.360 --> 09:42.150
Hurry!

197
09:42.440 --> 09:44.030
Hurry up and fish them all up!

198
09:44.030 --> 09:44.790
My Lord,

199
09:45.030 --> 09:47.440
there is something I don't know if I should say.

200
09:47.440 --> 09:48.360
Go ahead.

201
09:48.790 --> 09:49.930
At the bottom of this lake,

202
09:49.930 --> 09:51.590
not only are there many bones,

203
09:51.750 --> 09:53.750
but also several large stone locks.

204
09:54.000 --> 09:55.600
The stone locks are connected to iron chains.

205
09:55.600 --> 09:56.630
Some of the iron chains

206
09:56.630 --> 09:57.960
are wrapped with bones.

207
09:59.030 --> 10:00.370
In my opinion,

208
10:00.440 --> 10:02.970
they must have been used to weigh bodies down.

209
10:41.630 --> 10:43.130
Gong Sihai!

210
10:44.790 --> 10:46.200
Was it you who sank these people

211
10:46.200 --> 10:47.550
into the lake?

212
10:48.360 --> 10:50.000
So many lives!

213
10:51.000 --> 10:51.840
You people...

214
10:52.280 --> 10:54.360
You people are simply insane!

215
11:12.580 --> 11:13.770
Hao!

216
11:14.840 --> 11:15.880
Chen!

217
11:24.670 --> 11:25.630
Hao!

218
11:29.240 --> 11:30.960
Chen!

219
11:33.390 --> 11:36.670
My poor children!

220
11:39.000 --> 11:40.260
After all these years,

221
11:40.480 --> 11:42.000
you must be tired.

222
11:50.270 --> 11:52.440
Now you can finally lie down

223
11:52.440 --> 11:54.910
and have a good rest.

224
11:56.960 --> 11:59.320
Hao!

225
12:01.550 --> 12:04.200
Chen!

226
12:09.670 --> 12:11.670
All I regret is that I've lived this long,

227
12:11.670 --> 12:13.390
with these broken old bones,

228
12:14.150 --> 12:16.200
paying tribute to you

229
12:16.200 --> 12:17.960
night after night,

230
12:18.630 --> 12:21.630
yet never able to be reunited with you.

231
12:29.440 --> 12:33.910
At long last, I've lived to see this day!

232
12:42.270 --> 12:43.360
Old Madam Gong

233
12:44.030 --> 12:46.000
must have seen her family

234
12:46.600 --> 12:47.840
chained by the feet

235
12:47.840 --> 12:49.100
and sunk into the lake.

236
12:49.840 --> 12:51.150
Their bodies rotted and swelled,

237
12:51.150 --> 12:52.280
making them buoyant

238
12:52.750 --> 12:54.080
and causing them to stand upright in the water

239
12:54.080 --> 12:55.480
like a forest of corpses.

240
12:56.030 --> 12:57.690
That's why she always mutters

241
12:58.200 --> 13:00.080
about wanting her family to lie down

242
13:00.080 --> 13:01.270
and rest well.

243
13:09.000 --> 13:10.700
Gong Sihai!

244
13:10.960 --> 13:13.830
Even if you die a thousand times,

245
13:14.240 --> 13:16.200
it won't erase the sins

246
13:16.200 --> 13:19.440
you committed against our Gong family!

247
13:21.200 --> 13:22.730
In the 20th year of Hongyun,

248
13:23.390 --> 13:26.790
the court appointed the Gong family to transport government salt.

249
13:26.790 --> 13:29.000
Soon after, Ji Ada came to our door,

250
13:29.440 --> 13:31.630
proposing to conspire with the Gong family

251
13:31.630 --> 13:33.000
to smuggle government salt.

252
13:33.000 --> 13:33.840
Madam,

253
13:35.030 --> 13:36.490
have you made up your mind?

254
13:36.940 --> 13:39.070
Hao, see the guest out.

255
13:40.240 --> 13:41.510
This way, Mr. Ji.

256
13:41.870 --> 13:45.080
[Virtue, Diligence, Serenity, and Peace]

257
13:45.080 --> 13:46.940
Who would expect that after that,

258
13:47.030 --> 13:48.510
Ji Ada would collude with the villain,

259
13:48.510 --> 13:49.510
Qiu Sihai,

260
13:49.850 --> 13:52.980
and slaughter almost the entire Gong family overnight.

261
14:01.630 --> 14:03.960
Chen!

262
14:15.750 --> 14:17.510
They left the youngest child alive

263
14:17.510 --> 14:18.510
as a hostage.

264
14:19.150 --> 14:21.150
To save my only grandson,

265
14:23.030 --> 14:24.270
I had to agree

266
14:24.270 --> 14:25.580
to their demands.

267
14:25.600 --> 14:26.840
Old Madam Gong,

268
14:27.600 --> 14:28.790
from now on,

269
14:29.840 --> 14:32.270
I will be your nephew.

270
14:40.000 --> 14:40.910
That year,

271
14:41.440 --> 14:44.170
a great plague happened to break out in Mingling.

272
14:44.390 --> 14:46.670
So Qiu Sihai spread the rumor,

273
14:47.440 --> 14:48.870
saying the 13 members of the Gong family

274
14:48.870 --> 14:50.530
all died suddenly of illness.

275
14:51.360 --> 14:52.480
Since then,

276
14:53.240 --> 14:55.000
the entire Gong family fell into the hands

277
14:55.000 --> 14:56.480
of Ji Ada and this beast

278
14:56.480 --> 14:57.960
surnamed Qiu.

279
14:59.840 --> 15:00.640
Grandmother.

280
15:01.840 --> 15:03.000
It was all my fault.

281
15:03.870 --> 15:05.200
I dragged you

282
15:05.790 --> 15:07.190
and the Gong family down.

283
15:09.630 --> 15:11.090
I am an unfilial grandson.

284
15:13.000 --> 15:14.200
Don't blame me for not

285
15:14.200 --> 15:16.200
passing the family property to you.

286
15:16.480 --> 15:18.200
I had to hand over the vault key

287
15:18.200 --> 15:19.910
and the ship seal.

288
15:20.840 --> 15:23.290
Only then did they promise not to kill you.

289
15:24.480 --> 15:26.150
I have never blamed you.

290
15:42.870 --> 15:44.000
Fourth Master Gong.

291
15:44.750 --> 15:45.550
No.

292
15:46.760 --> 15:48.480
I should call you Qiu Sihai,

293
15:49.000 --> 15:50.200
Chief Qiu.

294
15:50.630 --> 15:51.550
This time,

295
15:52.000 --> 15:54.150
you are in big trouble.

296
15:54.360 --> 15:55.630
Murder and robbery,

297
15:56.150 --> 15:57.610
theft of government salt,

298
15:58.360 --> 16:00.290
and embezzlement of public funds.

299
16:00.480 --> 16:02.080
I don't think even 100 heads would be enough

300
16:02.080 --> 16:02.960
for all your crimes.

301
16:02.960 --> 16:03.670
Shut up!

302
16:04.600 --> 16:05.870
I think you just

303
16:05.870 --> 16:07.470
have too many heads to spare!

304
16:07.630 --> 16:09.440
I'm sure you all know

305
16:10.000 --> 16:11.720
who the Ji brothers are.

306
16:11.870 --> 16:13.300
Over the years,

307
16:13.750 --> 16:16.000
how much of the money the Gong family earned,

308
16:16.000 --> 16:17.750
both openly and secretly,

309
16:18.150 --> 16:20.200
actually went into my pocket?

310
16:23.840 --> 16:25.390
The Divine Constable Bureau?

311
16:25.390 --> 16:28.150
Under imperial power, everything is the same.

312
16:29.080 --> 16:30.870
Take my advice.

313
16:31.000 --> 16:33.410
A wise man knows when to yield to circumstances.

314
16:33.410 --> 16:34.630
Since you

315
16:34.750 --> 16:36.550
came here on the Gong family's ship,

316
16:36.550 --> 16:38.910
I'll send you back

317
16:39.000 --> 16:40.720
in style.

318
16:41.200 --> 16:43.270
Don't make me do this the hard way.

319
16:44.150 --> 16:46.080
If this matter really blows up

320
16:46.080 --> 16:48.270
and the one above holds us accountable,

321
16:48.270 --> 16:50.220
no one can bear the consequences!

322
16:52.030 --> 16:53.320
Hearing you say this,

323
16:54.200 --> 16:56.200
it seems we are in big trouble.

324
16:57.550 --> 16:59.150
What should we do?

325
17:00.660 --> 17:01.920
Lord Constable Ghost,

326
17:02.000 --> 17:03.120
what do you think?

327
17:04.069 --> 17:04.960
Sorry,

328
17:06.200 --> 17:07.640
I only know how to kill.

329
17:09.000 --> 17:10.000
Lady Constable Frost?

330
17:10.000 --> 17:11.829
I only know how to perform autopsies.

331
17:11.829 --> 17:12.790
In that case...

332
17:13.030 --> 17:14.200
One kills,

333
17:14.480 --> 17:16.410
and the other performs autopsies.

334
17:16.440 --> 17:17.589
It seems

335
17:17.790 --> 17:18.660
you'll end up dead

336
17:18.660 --> 17:20.200
either way.

337
17:21.000 --> 17:22.680
Stop bluffing!

338
17:23.200 --> 17:25.260
Who in Mingling doesn't know

339
17:25.400 --> 17:27.060
who's behind the Ji brothers?

340
17:27.640 --> 17:28.480
Who dares name

341
17:28.480 --> 17:30.400
the real mastermind?

342
17:30.750 --> 17:32.580
I don't think any of you do!

343
17:32.830 --> 17:34.430
The one who instructed Ji Ada

344
17:34.790 --> 17:36.680
to collude with Gong's Shipping

345
17:37.000 --> 17:39.800
to resell government salt and line his own pockets

346
17:40.200 --> 17:43.620
is His Highness Prince Ding of Great Shi,

347
17:43.880 --> 17:45.300
the First Prince,

348
17:45.640 --> 17:46.550
Zhou Miao.

349
17:56.000 --> 17:56.830
Lord Li.

350
17:57.200 --> 17:58.480
I know you are upright,

351
17:58.640 --> 17:59.640
but some things

352
17:59.640 --> 18:01.170
shouldn't be said out loud.

353
18:01.240 --> 18:02.310
Why not?

354
18:03.750 --> 18:04.960
Right and wrong,

355
18:05.030 --> 18:06.410
good and evil,

356
18:06.440 --> 18:07.590
will be judged.

357
18:08.350 --> 18:09.920
There is justice in heaven,

358
18:09.960 --> 18:11.750
and fairness in people's hearts.

359
18:11.750 --> 18:13.560
Even if it's someone close to His Majesty

360
18:13.560 --> 18:14.960
within the imperial walls—

361
18:14.960 --> 18:16.820
if a prince breaks the law,

362
18:16.960 --> 18:19.090
he should be punished like a commoner.

363
18:31.780 --> 18:33.720
Well said.

364
18:44.830 --> 18:46.680
Then I

365
18:47.160 --> 18:48.680
will go with you today.

366
18:49.480 --> 18:50.510
I'd like to see

367
18:50.510 --> 18:51.510
how you will face the wrath

368
18:51.510 --> 18:55.110
of the one on the throne.

369
18:56.720 --> 18:57.510
Please!

370
19:03.310 --> 19:05.090
[Mingling County Government]

371
19:06.550 --> 19:07.350
Don't move!

372
19:08.110 --> 19:08.920
Hurry up!

373
19:09.350 --> 19:10.550
On the Gong family's ships,

374
19:10.550 --> 19:11.440
we did indeed find

375
19:11.440 --> 19:12.590
a lot of embezzled government salt.

376
19:12.590 --> 19:13.000
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

377
19:13.000 --> 19:14.240
-When we got on the ships, -Move!

378
19:14.240 --> 19:15.750
many of the Gong family's lackeys

379
19:15.750 --> 19:17.550
were mixing seawater into the bags

380
19:17.550 --> 19:18.960
in an attempt to destroy the evidence.

381
19:18.960 --> 19:19.490
Hurry up!

382
19:19.960 --> 19:21.620
Now that the cases are solved,

383
19:21.960 --> 19:23.830
I wonder when you Divine Constables

384
19:23.830 --> 19:25.160
will set off,

385
19:25.240 --> 19:26.790
so I can make arrangements.

386
19:33.310 --> 19:34.110
No rush.

387
19:34.960 --> 19:35.960
Let's wait a bit longer.

388
19:35.960 --> 19:38.200
What are you waiting for?

389
19:39.160 --> 19:39.960
My Lord.

390
19:40.830 --> 19:41.640
My Lord.

391
19:42.590 --> 19:44.270
My Lord. Divine Constable.

392
19:44.440 --> 19:45.350
We found Ji Ada.

393
19:45.350 --> 19:45.640
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

394
19:45.640 --> 19:46.720
How was he found?

395
19:46.830 --> 19:48.200
The body was washed up on the beach.

396
19:48.200 --> 19:50.600
It was found by beachcombers this morning.

397
20:18.200 --> 20:19.060
Second Master,

398
20:19.440 --> 20:21.000
don't worry too much.

399
20:21.440 --> 20:23.200
Now that he has been found,

400
20:23.200 --> 20:24.590
there's no need to rush.

401
20:25.440 --> 20:26.240
Xiuniang.

402
20:27.440 --> 20:29.400
I'm not anxious about my brother

403
20:29.400 --> 20:31.130
not being able to rest in peace.

404
20:31.350 --> 20:33.410
He clearly fell into the sea and died,

405
20:33.440 --> 20:34.750
but the county government

406
20:34.750 --> 20:35.790
wants to hand the body over

407
20:35.790 --> 20:37.830
to the Divine Constable Bureau for examination.

408
20:37.830 --> 20:39.350
This doesn't make sense.

409
20:41.590 --> 20:42.400
Unless

410
20:42.830 --> 20:44.160
there's a hidden truth.

411
20:44.590 --> 20:45.440
Maybe...

412
20:46.000 --> 20:47.440
Maybe the county magistrate

413
20:47.440 --> 20:49.240
just wants to save some trouble.

414
20:50.240 --> 20:51.000
No.

415
20:51.790 --> 20:52.990
It's still not right.

416
20:53.070 --> 20:54.720
Second Master, be careful!

417
20:54.830 --> 20:55.690
Second Master!

418
20:55.830 --> 20:56.690
Second Master.

419
20:57.000 --> 20:58.030
The Divine Constable Bureau is handling a case.

420
20:58.030 --> 20:58.790
No trespassing.

421
20:58.790 --> 20:59.510
Step back.

422
20:59.720 --> 21:00.650
Handling a case?

423
21:01.000 --> 21:02.200
What case?

424
21:02.400 --> 21:03.680
I'm looking for my brother.

425
21:03.680 --> 21:04.680
Let me in!

426
21:05.190 --> 21:06.200
[Coroner's Office]

427
21:06.200 --> 21:08.200
Come on. Sit down.

428
21:12.790 --> 21:13.590
What's wrong?

429
21:13.960 --> 21:15.270
Is something wrong?

430
21:15.830 --> 21:17.270
The cause of Ji Ada's death

431
21:17.270 --> 21:19.110
was not simply drowning.

432
21:20.200 --> 21:21.200
To be precise,

433
21:21.680 --> 21:23.680
drowning was just one of the causes.

434
21:24.160 --> 21:24.960
Look.

435
21:25.750 --> 21:27.100
The deceased's head and neck

436
21:27.100 --> 21:28.690
are covered in deep wounds.

437
21:37.830 --> 21:39.270
Isn't this because

438
21:39.480 --> 21:41.070
the sharp reefs on the seabed

439
21:41.070 --> 21:42.240
and the strong waves

440
21:42.440 --> 21:44.000
caused these injuries?

441
21:44.640 --> 21:45.900
Then why are there no wounds

442
21:45.900 --> 21:47.160
on the rest of the body,

443
21:47.350 --> 21:49.310
but only on the head and face?

444
21:49.680 --> 21:52.480
It could also have been caused by a large fish bite.

445
21:52.880 --> 21:54.280
But it wouldn't be fatal.

446
21:54.750 --> 21:56.070
It's not impossible.

447
21:56.680 --> 21:57.440
However...

448
21:58.270 --> 22:00.070
I saw this wound.

449
22:00.270 --> 22:01.550
Although the body is severely decomposed

450
22:01.550 --> 22:02.750
and hard to identify,

451
22:02.830 --> 22:03.790
take a look.

452
22:04.400 --> 22:05.960
This peculiar wound—

453
22:06.400 --> 22:07.860
doesn't it look familiar?

454
22:11.350 --> 22:13.160
Ji Ada, like Zhe Shan, had his throat

455
22:13.160 --> 22:14.820
crushed by an animal's teeth.

456
22:15.070 --> 22:17.270
He must have been severely bitten first

457
22:17.550 --> 22:19.210
and then drowned in the water.

458
22:20.200 --> 22:21.000
So,

459
22:21.350 --> 22:22.590
he had been ashore?

460
22:23.070 --> 22:24.070
That couldn't be.

461
22:24.880 --> 22:25.960
When Ji Ada fell

462
22:25.960 --> 22:27.070
from the Tingchao Boat,

463
22:27.070 --> 22:28.240
we had just locked Xia Jiuying

464
22:28.240 --> 22:29.200
in prison.

465
22:29.880 --> 22:30.880
Besides,

466
22:31.070 --> 22:33.440
the demon wolf was killed by Lou Tianming.

467
22:33.880 --> 22:35.400
How could it bite Ji Ada to death

468
22:35.400 --> 22:36.640
when he came ashore?

469
22:37.790 --> 22:38.640
Could it be...

470
22:39.680 --> 22:42.000
that he wasn't bitten by the green-haired demon?

471
22:42.000 --> 22:43.000
In that case...

472
22:43.680 --> 22:45.880
it should have been Black Silk Leopard.

473
22:47.880 --> 22:49.030
So Ji Ada

474
22:49.350 --> 22:51.210
finally managed to climb ashore,

475
22:51.270 --> 22:52.070
only to

476
22:52.350 --> 22:55.070
have Gong Sihai sic his dog on him.

477
22:56.200 --> 22:57.270
The Ji and Gong families

478
22:57.270 --> 22:59.070
were colluding to sell government salt.

479
22:59.070 --> 23:00.270
Gong Sihai had no reason to kill

480
23:00.270 --> 23:01.200
his partner.

481
23:01.240 --> 23:02.960
Seeing that we were onto them,

482
23:04.000 --> 23:05.000
he silenced him.

483
23:08.270 --> 23:10.240
Rather than silencing him, which would

484
23:10.240 --> 23:12.240
only cause trouble without gaining anything,

485
23:12.240 --> 23:14.400
it would've been much simpler

486
23:14.400 --> 23:15.590
to rely on the Ji family

487
23:15.590 --> 23:17.030
for protection.

488
23:17.790 --> 23:19.880
Gong Sihai indeed had

489
23:19.880 --> 23:21.400
no motive to kill Ji Ada.

490
23:22.050 --> 23:24.220
The killer is someone else.

491
23:25.350 --> 23:26.160
This person

492
23:26.960 --> 23:29.020
can also control Black Silk Leopard.

493
23:34.440 --> 23:36.100
The Ji family came to Mingling

494
23:36.350 --> 23:37.880
in the 20th year of Hongyun.

495
23:39.030 --> 23:40.440
That was also the year the Gong family

496
23:40.440 --> 23:41.720
ran into trouble and began conspiring

497
23:41.720 --> 23:42.750
with the Ji family

498
23:43.000 --> 23:44.680
to resell government salt.

499
23:46.270 --> 23:48.240
It was right after my eldest and second brothers

500
23:48.240 --> 23:49.790
conspired against me.

501
23:52.120 --> 23:54.680
The man behind the Ji family is Eldest Brother.

502
23:54.680 --> 23:56.160
And Xiu Wei, the key figure

503
23:56.160 --> 23:57.070
in the false military intelligence report

504
23:57.070 --> 23:58.880
he issued while he was in the Ministry of War,

505
23:58.880 --> 24:00.550
disappeared in Mingling.

506
24:02.240 --> 24:03.030
As expected,

507
24:04.240 --> 24:06.240
it all ties together now.

508
24:13.590 --> 24:14.450
Second Master,

509
24:15.640 --> 24:17.350
it's time to go back and take your medicine.

510
24:17.350 --> 24:19.030
At a time like this,

511
24:19.550 --> 24:21.070
you're talking about taking medicine?

512
24:21.070 --> 24:21.930
Second Master!

513
24:22.440 --> 24:23.160
Let's go.

514
24:23.160 --> 24:24.550
You must take care of your health.

515
24:24.550 --> 24:25.480
Let's go back.

516
24:25.590 --> 24:26.310
Waiting here

517
24:26.310 --> 24:27.650
is not a solution.

518
24:27.680 --> 24:29.550
Let's go back and take your medicine.

519
24:29.550 --> 24:30.350
Ji Er!

520
24:30.790 --> 24:31.340
My Lord?

521
24:31.340 --> 24:34.620
[Coroner's Office]

522
24:35.030 --> 24:36.160
My Lord,

523
24:36.880 --> 24:38.270
can you let me in

524
24:38.750 --> 24:40.240
and take my brother away?

525
24:40.680 --> 24:41.480
Ji Er,

526
24:41.750 --> 24:42.910
do you know that Ji Ada

527
24:42.910 --> 24:44.680
is suspected of colluding with Gong Sihai

528
24:44.680 --> 24:46.490
and reselling government salt?

529
24:46.680 --> 24:48.880
I heard it from the servants on the way here.

530
24:48.880 --> 24:49.680
My Lord,

531
24:50.240 --> 24:51.350
is this true?

532
24:51.350 --> 24:54.240
[Coroner's Office]

533
24:54.240 --> 24:55.920
I will have the entire Ji Mansion

534
24:55.920 --> 24:56.830
and everyone in it,

535
24:56.830 --> 24:59.200
including all properties, seized!

536
24:59.400 --> 25:00.550
Second Young Master Ji,

537
25:00.550 --> 25:01.810
please lead the way

538
25:02.000 --> 25:03.270
to Ji Mansion!

539
25:03.750 --> 25:04.550
My Lord,

540
25:05.200 --> 25:07.000
why are you seizing Ji Mansion?

541
25:09.070 --> 25:09.880
My Lord!

542
25:11.680 --> 25:12.540
Second Master!

543
25:13.070 --> 25:13.930
Second Master!

544
25:14.750 --> 25:15.610
Second Master!

545
25:16.230 --> 25:17.030
My Lord,

546
25:17.160 --> 25:18.890
our Second Master is innocent!

547
25:19.000 --> 25:20.680
He has been in poor health since childhood.

548
25:20.680 --> 25:22.270
He has always been controlled and restricted

549
25:22.270 --> 25:23.130
by his brother.

550
25:23.200 --> 25:24.850
He was never allowed

551
25:24.880 --> 25:25.640
to handle any affairs

552
25:25.640 --> 25:26.790
in the mansion.

553
25:26.790 --> 25:27.480
How could he know anything

554
25:27.480 --> 25:29.410
about reselling government salt?

555
25:29.470 --> 25:29.550
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

556
25:29.550 --> 25:31.030
Now that his brother has just passed away,

557
25:31.030 --> 25:32.430
you're saying such things.

558
25:32.430 --> 25:32.960
Aren't you

559
25:32.960 --> 25:34.820
trying to kill our Second Master?

560
25:36.050 --> 25:36.640
[Coroner's Office]

561
25:36.640 --> 25:38.200
Go get a doctor now.

562
25:38.200 --> 25:38.600
Yes.

563
25:38.600 --> 25:39.540
[As Bright as the Sun and Moon]

564
25:40.640 --> 25:41.830
Hurry up and help him

565
25:41.830 --> 25:42.940
to the back hall to rest!

566
25:42.940 --> 25:43.070
[As Bright as the Sun and Moon]

567
25:43.070 --> 25:43.880
Yes.

568
25:45.240 --> 25:46.030
Come on.

569
25:50.400 --> 25:51.730
Come on, Second Master.

570
25:59.000 --> 26:00.060
Young Master Gong.

571
26:01.240 --> 26:02.500
Letting you in to visit

572
26:02.640 --> 26:04.040
is already an exception.

573
26:04.070 --> 26:06.350
If you have anything to say, say it quickly.

574
26:06.350 --> 26:07.480
Thank you, officer.

575
26:13.960 --> 26:14.750
Jiuying!

576
26:15.640 --> 26:16.480
Jiuying!

577
26:18.750 --> 26:19.550
Jiuying!

578
26:25.480 --> 26:26.240
Hurry up.

579
26:32.470 --> 26:33.400
Jiuying.

580
26:45.790 --> 26:46.790
I heard

581
26:47.200 --> 26:49.370
that the terrible green-haired demon

582
26:49.400 --> 26:51.010
is your alpha wolf.

583
26:51.790 --> 26:52.650
Why did you never

584
26:52.650 --> 26:53.770
tell me about it?

585
26:58.070 --> 26:59.720
Alpha wolf...

586
27:03.640 --> 27:05.400
It's dead...

587
27:12.720 --> 27:14.700
It's dead!

588
27:15.920 --> 27:17.110
You like it so much,

589
27:17.550 --> 27:19.210
and it listened to you so well.

590
27:19.720 --> 27:21.520
You must have been good friends.

591
27:25.350 --> 27:27.070
I thought you were like me,

592
27:27.960 --> 27:29.290
having only one friend.

593
27:31.160 --> 27:33.680
But I hope you will have

594
27:33.680 --> 27:35.550
many more friends.

595
27:37.960 --> 27:38.830
You and I

596
27:39.880 --> 27:41.280
are different after all.

597
28:02.640 --> 28:03.510
Don't worry.

598
28:06.790 --> 28:07.960
You'll be fine.

599
28:09.030 --> 28:10.550
You didn't kill Zhe Shan.

600
28:11.680 --> 28:12.480
I know

601
28:13.070 --> 28:14.800
you would never let your friend

602
28:15.240 --> 28:16.350
kill for you.

603
28:17.310 --> 28:18.350
You never had

604
28:18.350 --> 28:20.010
the intention to kill anyone.

605
28:21.510 --> 28:24.350
The Divine Constable Bureau will find out the truth

606
28:24.350 --> 28:25.640
and clear your name.

607
28:26.830 --> 28:28.030
When that time comes,

608
28:28.750 --> 28:29.830
leave Mingling.

609
28:32.110 --> 28:33.570
Go anywhere you want to go.

610
28:36.720 --> 28:37.920
Go see

611
28:37.920 --> 28:39.320
the outside world for me.

612
28:56.110 --> 28:57.310
Divine Constable Li.

613
28:57.880 --> 28:59.130
The kitchen has prepared

614
28:59.130 --> 29:00.260
a few simple dishes.

615
29:00.510 --> 29:02.030
It's just plain food.

616
29:02.030 --> 29:03.690
Please don't mind it, My Lord.

617
29:07.510 --> 29:08.720
Where is your lord?

618
29:08.920 --> 29:09.680
Why not

619
29:10.440 --> 29:12.240
ask him to come and eat together?

620
29:13.440 --> 29:15.640
The heavy rain the day before yesterday washed away the flood channel.

621
29:15.640 --> 29:16.430
Our lord

622
29:16.450 --> 29:18.110
is busy investigating the Ji family

623
29:18.110 --> 29:19.310
and repairing the channel.

624
29:19.310 --> 29:20.880
He is completely tied up.

625
29:21.000 --> 29:21.790
I'll deliver his meal

626
29:21.790 --> 29:23.640
to the construction site later.

627
29:25.110 --> 29:26.040
Enjoy your meal.

628
29:26.110 --> 29:26.920
Alright.

629
29:42.480 --> 29:43.310
Put it here.

630
29:43.510 --> 29:44.680
Come on, come on.

631
29:44.680 --> 29:45.400
Careful.

632
29:53.150 --> 29:54.500
Give me a hand.

633
29:57.400 --> 29:58.440
It's almost done.

634
30:04.640 --> 30:05.440
Lai.

635
30:06.240 --> 30:07.680
Did Young Master Gong

636
30:07.830 --> 30:08.920
go to the prison

637
30:08.920 --> 30:10.630
to visit Xia Jiuying?

638
30:11.000 --> 30:13.110
Divine Constable Li, you truly are clairvoyant.

639
30:13.110 --> 30:14.310
As you instructed,

640
30:14.400 --> 30:15.930
I arranged for them to meet.

641
30:16.310 --> 30:18.770
Please enjoy your meal, Divine Constables.

642
30:20.270 --> 30:21.400
Guys, listen to me.

643
30:22.030 --> 30:23.680
The number one coroner of Great Shi

644
30:23.680 --> 30:25.080
has made a new discovery.

645
30:27.920 --> 30:29.310
I found a strange mark

646
30:29.310 --> 30:30.920
on the deceased's face.

647
30:33.070 --> 30:34.030
What mark?

648
30:34.590 --> 30:36.030
After she told me,

649
30:36.270 --> 30:37.930
I observed it for a long time,

650
30:38.310 --> 30:39.680
but I just couldn't see it.

651
30:39.680 --> 30:40.480
Of course,

652
30:40.720 --> 30:42.580
I didn't dare to look too closely.

653
30:42.920 --> 30:44.000
It made me sick.

654
30:44.920 --> 30:46.440
Right in the middle of the face,

655
30:46.440 --> 30:47.410
there is a very faint,

656
30:47.410 --> 30:49.210
very light brown mark.

657
30:49.240 --> 30:50.680
You can't see it if you don't look closely.

658
30:50.680 --> 30:52.030
Even I almost missed it.

659
30:52.480 --> 30:53.680
A brown mark?

660
30:54.640 --> 30:55.830
Could it be

661
30:56.270 --> 30:57.480
some kind of bruise?

662
30:58.110 --> 31:00.680
I think it looks more like the person was exposed

663
31:00.680 --> 31:01.680
to the sun after death,

664
31:01.680 --> 31:02.880
leaving a sunburn.

665
31:05.830 --> 31:06.680
Sunburn?

666
31:07.400 --> 31:08.860
The sun is harsh out at sea.

667
31:08.920 --> 31:10.310
After floating on the surface

668
31:10.310 --> 31:11.440
for several days,

669
31:11.440 --> 31:13.240
a body can easily get sunburned.

670
31:14.030 --> 31:15.310
As far as I know,

671
31:15.640 --> 31:17.680
men's Yang energy gathers in the face,

672
31:17.680 --> 31:19.880
making the face heavy, so drowned men always float face down.

673
31:19.880 --> 31:21.830
Women's Yin energy gathers in the back,

674
31:21.830 --> 31:24.110
making the back heavy, so drowned women always float face up.

675
31:24.110 --> 31:25.950
Therefore, male corpses generally float face down,

676
31:25.950 --> 31:27.720
while female corpses float face up.

677
31:27.720 --> 31:29.830
How could a corpse floating face down

678
31:30.270 --> 31:32.110
get sunburned?

679
31:32.720 --> 31:33.610
Those are

680
31:33.630 --> 31:34.880
just superstitions, after all.

681
31:34.880 --> 31:36.590
They may not be entirely credible.

682
31:36.590 --> 31:37.690
And based on my previous

683
31:37.690 --> 31:39.070
experience with floating corpse cases,

684
31:39.070 --> 31:40.480
there are many exceptions.

685
31:40.480 --> 31:41.680
But the problem is

686
31:42.200 --> 31:43.930
the shape of that sunburn mark.

687
31:53.830 --> 31:54.990
It's as if only a single beam of sunlight

688
31:54.990 --> 31:56.750
came down from the sky

689
31:59.070 --> 32:00.730
and burned just this one spot.

690
32:03.920 --> 32:05.520
Don't you find that strange?

691
32:05.830 --> 32:06.920
Logically speaking,

692
32:06.920 --> 32:09.270
if the body had been burned by the sun while floating at sea,

693
32:09.270 --> 32:10.160
the entire face

694
32:10.190 --> 32:11.590
should have been burned.

695
32:14.030 --> 32:15.200
In that case,

696
32:15.400 --> 32:17.130
there is only one possibility.

697
32:17.270 --> 32:18.270
The body

698
32:18.400 --> 32:20.070
wasn't dumped into the sea right after death.

699
32:20.070 --> 32:20.880
It was kept

700
32:21.720 --> 32:22.720
somewhere

701
32:23.310 --> 32:25.240
with direct sunlight

702
32:25.440 --> 32:26.570
for some time first.

703
32:26.640 --> 32:27.440
Right.

704
32:27.790 --> 32:29.000
For a corpse to develop sunburn marks,

705
32:29.000 --> 32:30.680
it takes at least 2 days.

706
32:31.270 --> 32:31.790
However,

707
32:31.790 --> 32:33.790
judging from the degree of decomposition,

708
32:33.790 --> 32:35.310
the time the body was thrown into the water

709
32:35.310 --> 32:36.500
matches the time Ji Ada

710
32:36.500 --> 32:38.100
fell into the sea that night.

711
32:38.510 --> 32:39.510
Let me do the math.

712
32:39.830 --> 32:41.110
We spent 3 days

713
32:41.310 --> 32:43.110
just looking for him.

714
32:43.480 --> 32:44.830
Then it rained for a day.

715
32:45.070 --> 32:46.680
And we spent another day retrieving the bodies in Gong Mansion.

716
32:46.680 --> 32:47.790
Until the body was found,

717
32:47.790 --> 32:49.000
it was 5 days in total.

718
32:49.110 --> 32:51.640
Could he have been exposed to the sun for 2 days

719
32:52.030 --> 32:53.830
and then soaked in the sea for 3 days?

720
32:53.830 --> 32:55.070
Three days and five days

721
32:55.070 --> 32:55.960
are such a big difference.

722
32:55.960 --> 32:57.400
You think I can't tell?

723
32:57.400 --> 32:58.400
I'm sure

724
32:58.400 --> 32:59.310
it was 5 days.

725
32:59.790 --> 33:01.310
Even if Ji Ada went ashore

726
33:01.310 --> 33:03.110
and drowned after his throat was crushed,

727
33:03.110 --> 33:04.480
his time on shore

728
33:04.920 --> 33:06.380
must have been very short.

729
33:09.920 --> 33:11.050
Where are you going?

730
33:11.070 --> 33:11.920
Eat first.

731
33:11.920 --> 33:12.680
I'm full.

732
33:14.640 --> 33:16.880
Judging from the shape of the sunburn,

733
33:17.310 --> 33:18.880
the first place Ji Ada's body was dumped

734
33:18.880 --> 33:20.000
was not the sea.

735
33:21.720 --> 33:22.720
He fell into the sea,

736
33:22.720 --> 33:23.510
came ashore,

737
33:23.790 --> 33:25.120
had his throat crushed,

738
33:26.070 --> 33:27.110
drowned,

739
33:27.110 --> 33:28.440
developed sunburn marks,

740
33:28.440 --> 33:30.370
then was dumped into the sea again.

741
33:31.790 --> 33:33.000
The body had to remain there for at least 2 days

742
33:33.000 --> 33:34.510
without being discovered,

743
33:34.510 --> 33:35.680
with the face up

744
33:36.000 --> 33:38.400
and a single beam of sunlight shining on it.

745
33:38.510 --> 33:39.720
And during this whole time,

746
33:39.720 --> 33:41.830
the body had to stay in the water.

747
33:42.790 --> 33:44.510
What kind of place

748
33:45.310 --> 33:47.170
could meet all these conditions?

749
33:48.510 --> 33:49.470
Could...

750
33:49.920 --> 33:52.310
someone in this county have built a secret water prison

751
33:52.310 --> 33:53.790
to hold people?

752
34:11.230 --> 34:14.290
You are not allowed to meddle in the mansion's affairs!

753
34:16.320 --> 34:17.110
Please,

754
34:17.280 --> 34:18.280
save my friend!

755
34:22.110 --> 34:23.679
The entire Gong Mansion

756
34:23.920 --> 34:25.070
hasn't belonged to the Gong family for a long time!

757
34:25.070 --> 34:26.920
Hao!

758
34:27.440 --> 34:29.400
You!

759
34:36.630 --> 34:36.850
[This Sihai is fake. He's illegally selling government salt]

760
34:41.800 --> 34:43.460
Have you thought of anything?

761
34:43.880 --> 34:45.070
Not yet.

762
34:45.840 --> 34:46.630
Get up.

763
34:48.440 --> 34:49.639
Wait a little longer.

764
34:53.580 --> 34:54.840
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

765
34:54.840 --> 34:55.900
Divine Constable.

766
34:56.400 --> 34:57.190
Hurry.

767
34:58.600 --> 34:59.160
Put that

768
34:59.190 --> 34:59.960
over there.

769
35:00.920 --> 35:02.030
What are you doing?

770
35:02.710 --> 35:04.030
Our lord asked us to take this stone table

771
35:04.030 --> 35:05.000
and use it to build the flood channel.

772
35:05.000 --> 35:05.710
Hurry up. Let's go.

773
35:05.710 --> 35:06.400
Let's go.

774
35:14.920 --> 35:15.880
I see.

775
35:19.630 --> 35:20.440
Qingyang,

776
35:20.480 --> 35:21.880
what are you looking for?

777
35:24.000 --> 35:25.140
I don't know.

778
35:26.320 --> 35:27.870
It could be an object,

779
35:28.110 --> 35:29.160
or it could be

780
35:29.920 --> 35:31.520
a trace.

781
35:32.070 --> 35:32.880
Anyway,

782
35:33.400 --> 35:35.060
it must be something unusual.

783
35:36.320 --> 35:38.380
Whenever a murderer commits a crime,

784
35:38.670 --> 35:40.670
they will definitely leave traces.

785
35:41.070 --> 35:42.800
You are searching along the flood channel.

786
35:42.800 --> 35:44.510
Do you think the murderer

787
35:44.510 --> 35:45.460
has something to do with it?

788
35:45.460 --> 35:46.730
Don't you think

789
35:46.840 --> 35:48.090
this flood channel,

790
35:48.320 --> 35:49.780
about the width of a person

791
35:49.800 --> 35:51.400
and covered with stone slabs,

792
35:51.400 --> 35:52.360
is the perfect place

793
35:52.360 --> 35:54.340
to hide a body?

794
35:54.710 --> 35:56.320
What's more brilliant is that

795
35:56.320 --> 35:57.920
not only can it hide bodies,

796
35:57.920 --> 35:59.880
but it can also be used to move them.

797
36:00.400 --> 36:01.240
So,

798
36:01.480 --> 36:03.140
this is the real dumping site.

799
36:06.000 --> 36:08.590
Situ Bo is leading his men to carry out earthworks everywhere.

800
36:08.590 --> 36:09.860
These flood channels

801
36:10.030 --> 36:11.690
are all over the city.

802
36:15.480 --> 36:16.280
So,

803
36:16.800 --> 36:18.060
as long as we determine

804
36:18.060 --> 36:18.670
[Reservoir] [Secret Channel]

805
36:18.670 --> 36:19.840
which section of the flood channel

806
36:19.840 --> 36:21.800
the body was hidden in,

807
36:22.440 --> 36:24.320
we will find the crime scene.

808
36:44.280 --> 36:46.110
There used to be a stone here.

809
36:46.880 --> 36:48.840
Judging from the moss around,

810
36:49.400 --> 36:50.320
it's about...

811
37:03.150 --> 37:04.960
No wonder the head and neck of the body

812
37:04.960 --> 37:06.150
had so many wounds.

813
37:06.800 --> 37:09.510
This must be the crime scene.

814
37:10.320 --> 37:12.440
Although the heavy rain overnight

815
37:12.470 --> 37:13.920
washed the bloodstains on the ground away

816
37:13.920 --> 37:15.400
completely,

817
37:15.550 --> 37:16.360
there

818
37:16.710 --> 37:18.440
must still be traces to follow.

819
37:44.190 --> 37:44.960
Right here.

820
37:44.980 --> 37:46.420
Come on, open it.

821
37:53.300 --> 37:54.090
Let me do it.

822
37:57.710 --> 37:58.510
Be careful!

823
37:58.920 --> 37:59.710
Come on!

824
38:00.510 --> 38:01.320
Come on!

825
38:02.710 --> 38:03.510
Careful.

826
38:11.550 --> 38:12.360
How is it?

827
38:14.800 --> 38:16.330
Just give me 2 days,

828
38:16.480 --> 38:17.920
and I can give you a sunburn mark

829
38:17.920 --> 38:19.850
exactly like the one on the victim.

830
38:25.110 --> 38:25.880
Careful.

831
38:33.320 --> 38:34.230
Obviously,

832
38:34.710 --> 38:36.560
the killer must know the weather in Mingling

833
38:36.560 --> 38:37.960
like the back of his hand.

834
38:38.480 --> 38:39.710
He first manipulated

835
38:39.880 --> 38:41.190
Black Silk Leopard

836
38:41.210 --> 38:43.140
to crush the victim's throat here,

837
38:43.320 --> 38:44.110
and then

838
38:44.320 --> 38:46.190
threw him into the flood channel.

839
38:46.630 --> 38:47.510
Next,

840
38:47.710 --> 38:49.570
he just needed to wait patiently.

841
38:49.840 --> 38:51.000
Because he knew

842
38:51.700 --> 38:52.990
that in two days,

843
38:53.190 --> 38:55.440
there would be a heavy rain.

844
38:56.320 --> 38:57.480
Lord Situ.

845
38:57.570 --> 38:58.030
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

846
38:58.030 --> 38:59.030
The rain today

847
38:59.630 --> 39:01.960
seems even heavier than the past few days.

848
39:02.030 --> 39:03.000
Indeed.

849
39:03.280 --> 39:04.110
The flood channel we just built

850
39:04.110 --> 39:05.880
a few days ago has been washed away

851
39:05.880 --> 39:07.190
in several places.

852
39:07.480 --> 39:08.750
In your opinion,

853
39:09.110 --> 39:11.280
when will the rain stop?

854
39:11.670 --> 39:12.930
It will stop tomorrow.

855
39:13.190 --> 39:14.320
A day of heavy rain

856
39:14.590 --> 39:16.190
was enough to form a torrent,

857
39:16.190 --> 39:18.800
washing the body down the flood channel

858
39:18.920 --> 39:20.580
all the way into the Yan River,

859
39:20.590 --> 39:22.970
then from the river into the sea,

860
39:23.110 --> 39:25.190
until it washed ashore

861
39:25.320 --> 39:26.450
and was discovered.

862
39:27.190 --> 39:28.480
Just like this,

863
39:28.840 --> 39:29.800
the killer

864
39:29.800 --> 39:32.430
disposed of the body effortlessly

865
39:32.430 --> 39:33.320
without

866
39:33.320 --> 39:35.190
even leaving the house.

867
39:35.710 --> 39:36.630
But

868
39:37.070 --> 39:38.710
we watched with our own eyes

869
39:38.710 --> 39:39.880
as Ji Ada

870
39:40.110 --> 39:42.370
fell into the sea from the Tingchao Boat.

871
39:43.030 --> 39:44.780
How could he end up here

872
39:44.880 --> 39:46.190
and get bitten by a dog?

873
39:47.320 --> 39:49.480
There is one more thing to confirm.

874
39:50.800 --> 39:51.360
My Lord,

875
39:51.360 --> 39:52.480
I don't know the details.

876
39:52.480 --> 39:53.350
Hurry up.

877
39:54.710 --> 39:55.570
Registrar Liu.

878
39:58.070 --> 39:59.590
I am Liu Cheng, the registrar of the county government.

879
39:59.590 --> 40:00.800
Greetings, Divine Constable.

880
40:00.800 --> 40:03.260
Thank you for your hard work, Registrar Liu.

881
40:05.840 --> 40:06.880
Please make sure

882
40:07.110 --> 40:08.880
to count these valuables carefully,

883
40:08.880 --> 40:10.000
keep them safe,

884
40:10.110 --> 40:11.840
and don't let them get damaged.

885
40:11.840 --> 40:13.920
If they are found to be stolen goods in the future,

886
40:13.920 --> 40:16.320
they will be confiscated and turned over to the state treasury.

887
40:16.320 --> 40:17.390
But if they are the Gong family's

888
40:17.390 --> 40:18.320
own belongings,

889
40:18.590 --> 40:20.250
they must be returned in full.

890
40:20.630 --> 40:21.630
I understand.

891
40:23.710 --> 40:24.510
Do you know

892
40:25.070 --> 40:26.280
where Gong Le is?

893
40:26.280 --> 40:27.190
Right now,

894
40:27.320 --> 40:28.670
he should be taking care of

895
40:28.670 --> 40:29.710
Old Madam Gong.

896
40:30.190 --> 40:31.710
If you want to see him,

897
40:32.320 --> 40:33.900
I will go and fetch him for you.

898
40:33.900 --> 40:34.690
No need.

899
40:34.880 --> 40:35.740
Registrar Liu,

900
40:36.030 --> 40:38.070
since you were sent by the imperial court

901
40:38.070 --> 40:39.440
to seal up Gong Mansion,

902
40:39.440 --> 40:42.000
I believe you know everything in it

903
40:42.030 --> 40:43.480
like the back of your hand.

904
40:43.480 --> 40:44.280
Do you know

905
40:45.110 --> 40:46.710
where Gong Le's room is?

906
40:47.280 --> 40:48.230
I do.

907
40:49.480 --> 40:51.030
My Lord, up here

908
40:51.030 --> 40:52.630
is Gong Le's room.

909
40:54.190 --> 40:55.230
This is the attic

910
40:55.230 --> 40:56.360
Meng Rui and I saw in the backyard

911
40:56.360 --> 40:57.480
that night.

912
40:58.190 --> 40:59.000
My Lord,

913
40:59.070 --> 41:00.090
I don't understand.

914
41:00.090 --> 41:00.840
Why do you have to

915
41:00.840 --> 41:02.590
come here at night.

916
41:03.440 --> 41:05.400
That's exactly the reason I am here.

917
41:05.400 --> 41:06.190
Yes.

918
41:07.280 --> 41:08.800
Young Master Gong

919
41:08.920 --> 41:11.050
is a well-known scholar in our county.

920
41:11.800 --> 41:13.000
He's well-educated, well-mannered,

921
41:13.000 --> 41:14.320
and well-read.

922
41:15.070 --> 41:15.920
He's about to

923
41:15.920 --> 41:17.880
take the imperial exam this year.

924
41:18.320 --> 41:19.450
Who would have expected

925
41:19.450 --> 41:21.450
such a thing to happen in his family.

926
41:32.710 --> 41:34.510
Where can a tavern be found?

927
41:35.000 --> 41:38.200
A shepherd boy points to Xinghua Village in the distance.

928
41:38.590 --> 41:40.320
At the east end of Xinghua Alley

929
41:40.590 --> 41:42.710
is the famous Yulu Pavilion.

930
41:46.880 --> 41:48.630
Tasting wine and admiring flowers

931
41:48.630 --> 41:50.000
go perfectly together.

932
42:18.400 --> 42:20.730
From the Hound Pit in the west of the county

933
42:21.070 --> 42:22.670
to Yulu Pavilion in the east,

934
42:24.000 --> 42:26.630
Xinghua Alley is the only route.

935
42:27.480 --> 42:28.440
Clearly,

936
42:28.880 --> 42:30.480
Gong Le knew exactly

937
42:30.760 --> 42:31.550
when Zhe Shan

938
42:32.110 --> 42:33.510
came and went every time.

939
42:42.590 --> 42:44.480
Looks like Zhe Shan's body also wasn't first dumped

940
42:44.480 --> 42:45.670
in the Yan River.

941
42:45.710 --> 42:47.670
The methods used in the two throat-crushing cases

942
42:47.670 --> 42:49.400
were remarkably similar.

943
42:50.480 --> 42:51.550
But as for ordering Black Silk Leopard

944
42:51.550 --> 42:52.510
to attack someone,

945
42:52.510 --> 42:53.670
it seems only Gong Sihai

946
42:53.670 --> 42:54.800
could've done that.

947
42:55.510 --> 42:56.670
A vicious beast like that

948
42:56.670 --> 42:58.730
usually recognizes only one master.

949
42:58.880 --> 43:02.210
Could it be that the uncle and nephew were working together?

950
43:02.880 --> 43:04.510
To control a beast,

951
43:04.800 --> 43:05.590
actually,

952
43:06.110 --> 43:07.480
giving it commands

953
43:07.480 --> 43:08.710
isn't the only way.

954
43:12.280 --> 43:13.480
Do you remember that night

955
43:13.480 --> 43:15.410
when we sneaked into Gong Mansion?

956
43:21.920 --> 43:22.880
You mean that lantern?

957
43:22.880 --> 43:24.920
The Gong family is wealthy

958
43:25.030 --> 43:26.290
and values its facade.

959
43:27.190 --> 43:28.920
The windproof covers of the lanterns

960
43:28.920 --> 43:31.050
are painted with intricate patterns.

961
43:32.590 --> 43:33.710
And the colors

962
43:34.400 --> 43:36.880
are mostly red and yellow,

963
43:36.880 --> 43:38.670
which are warm

964
43:38.670 --> 43:39.600
and auspicious.

965
43:39.800 --> 43:42.260
There is no funeral in the mansion right now.

966
43:42.480 --> 43:43.480
How could they hang

967
43:43.480 --> 43:45.280
such plain white lanterns?

968
43:45.710 --> 43:47.320
There is only one possibility.

969
43:47.320 --> 43:48.520
This is not a lantern,

970
43:49.000 --> 43:51.130
but a candlestick covered with paper.

971
43:52.320 --> 43:53.480
This is what

972
43:53.710 --> 43:55.110
you and I saw that night.

973
43:55.400 --> 43:57.600
He was sending a signal to the backyard?

974
44:01.320 --> 44:02.180
Registrar Liu.

975
44:03.190 --> 44:04.000
My Lords.

976
44:04.320 --> 44:05.220
Are you two

977
44:05.250 --> 44:06.650
analyzing the case?

978
44:07.030 --> 44:09.480
I'm getting more and more confused.

979
44:09.800 --> 44:10.660
Registrar Liu.

980
44:11.590 --> 44:12.710
The case will be closed tomorrow.

981
44:12.710 --> 44:15.030
Please make sure

982
44:15.110 --> 44:16.710
to record everything in detail.

983
44:16.710 --> 44:18.920
When this case is reported to the Divine Constable Bureau,

984
44:18.920 --> 44:20.840
whether the Chief is satisfied

985
44:21.190 --> 44:22.950
will all depend on you.

986
44:24.710 --> 44:25.510
Well...

987
44:38.320 --> 44:39.880
Divine Constables.

988
45:03.280 --> 45:04.010
The Divine Constable Tally is here.

989
45:04.010 --> 45:04.870
[Divine Constable Tally]

990
45:05.070 --> 45:07.030
Listen carefully, suspects.

991
45:07.590 --> 45:08.880
If you tell the truth now,

992
45:08.880 --> 45:10.400
you can still keep some dignity.

993
45:10.400 --> 45:12.030
But if you lie,

994
45:12.630 --> 45:14.110
let's see if your heads

995
45:14.110 --> 45:15.400
are harder than the execution blade

996
45:15.400 --> 45:16.710
besaide the Shangfang Drum.

997
45:16.710 --> 45:17.840
From this moment on,

998
45:18.400 --> 45:20.190
Mingling County is on lockdown.

999
45:20.190 --> 45:22.710
The ban will be lifted once the truth is clear.

1000
45:22.710 --> 45:23.570
Sound the drum.

1001
45:24.190 --> 45:25.000
Start the interrogation!
